# Queen's Bay Paladin (5/4): "Whenever this creature enters or attacks, return up to one target Vampire card from your graveyard to the
# battlefield with a finality counter on it. You lose life equal to its mana value." Turn 1 Bot1 casts Barony Vampire (3/2, mana value 3)
# off a Black Lotus; on turn 2 Bot2 casts Vampire Hexmage (mana value 2) off its own Black Lotus and Bolts both: the Barony in Bot1's
# graveyard and the Hexmage in Bot2's. On turn 3 Bot1 casts the Paladin off two Black Lotuses. The trigger refuses a Black Lotus (no
# Vampire), and Bot2's Hexmage (not in Bot1's graveyard); it returns the Barony Vampire with a finality counter and Bot1 loses 3, not 2.
# On turn 4 Bot2's third Bolt kills the Barony and the finality counter exiles it instead (CR 122.1h).

